{"4862720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PAR52", "steam_appid": 4862720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5106090], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/0a91ef5f2f3e0193676ccdbca124c304.poster.avif?t=1788072589\" width=438 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/0a91ef5f2f3e0193676ccdbca124c304.webm?t=1788072589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/0a91ef5f2f3e0193676ccdbca124c304.mp4?t=1788072589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the garden, every snail wants to have the best collection of playing cards. To find the rarest cards, they must play hex-grid mini-golf. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/d2a1ab21b8f57c6716dba7c8c7e9bdb3.poster.avif?t=1788072589\" width=608 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/d2a1ab21b8f57c6716dba7c8c7e9bdb3.webm?t=1788072589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/d2a1ab21b8f57c6716dba7c8c7e9bdb3.mp4?t=1788072589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card is a move: the values are distance and the suits overcome the terrain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/89bb02f1cedd5939d3ebb25f250e4ce3.poster.avif?t=1788072589\" width=446 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/89bb02f1cedd5939d3ebb25f250e4ce3.webm?t=1788072589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/89bb02f1cedd5939d3ebb25f250e4ce3.mp4?t=1788072589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♥️ Hearts skip across water</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♠️ Spades play through sand</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♣️ Clubs chip over obstacles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦️ Diamonds ricochet around corners</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔮 Special suits unlock even more abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a long way for a snail to go, but with your help they can reach their friends, trade cards and craft the most enviable collections.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/5c64c87623c39cd1d1f55e0e7aae24be.poster.avif?t=1788072589\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/5c64c87623c39cd1d1f55e0e7aae24be.webm?t=1788072589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/5c64c87623c39cd1d1f55e0e7aae24be.mp4?t=1788072589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get high scores, bargain and trade card combos to unlock new suits, mechanics and cosmetics. Collect every card in the garden and become the most enviable snail!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/5303b0f761a4add2331e28885ecebdee.poster.avif?t=1788072589\" width=542 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/5303b0f761a4add2331e28885ecebdee.webm?t=1788072589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/5303b0f761a4add2331e28885ecebdee.mp4?t=1788072589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>PAR52 is a game from TwoPM Studios: two friends making their weird ideas real.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/0a91ef5f2f3e0193676ccdbca124c304.poster.avif?t=1788072589\" width=438 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/0a91ef5f2f3e0193676ccdbca124c304.webm?t=1788072589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/0a91ef5f2f3e0193676ccdbca124c304.mp4?t=1788072589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the garden, every snail wants to have the best collection of playing cards. To find the rarest cards, they must play hex-grid mini-golf. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/d2a1ab21b8f57c6716dba7c8c7e9bdb3.poster.avif?t=1788072589\" width=608 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/d2a1ab21b8f57c6716dba7c8c7e9bdb3.webm?t=1788072589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/d2a1ab21b8f57c6716dba7c8c7e9bdb3.mp4?t=1788072589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card is a move: the values are distance and the suits overcome the terrain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/89bb02f1cedd5939d3ebb25f250e4ce3.poster.avif?t=1788072589\" width=446 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/89bb02f1cedd5939d3ebb25f250e4ce3.webm?t=1788072589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/89bb02f1cedd5939d3ebb25f250e4ce3.mp4?t=1788072589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♥️ Hearts skip across water</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♠️ Spades play through sand</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♣️ Clubs chip over obstacles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♦️ Diamonds ricochet around corners</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔮 Special suits unlock even more abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a long way for a snail to go, but with your help they can reach their friends, trade cards and craft the most enviable collections.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/5c64c87623c39cd1d1f55e0e7aae24be.poster.avif?t=1788072589\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/5c64c87623c39cd1d1f55e0e7aae24be.webm?t=1788072589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/5c64c87623c39cd1d1f55e0e7aae24be.mp4?t=1788072589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get high scores, bargain and trade card combos to unlock new suits, mechanics and cosmetics. Collect every card in the garden and become the most enviable snail!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/5303b0f761a4add2331e28885ecebdee.poster.avif?t=1788072589\" width=542 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/5303b0f761a4add2331e28885ecebdee.webm?t=1788072589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/extras/5303b0f761a4add2331e28885ecebdee.mp4?t=1788072589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>PAR52 is a game from TwoPM Studios: two friends making their weird ideas real.</i></p>", "short_description": "Help snails complete their playing card collections by solving mini-golf challenges. Collect every card in the garden and become the most enviable snail!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/36b8f08538e623e567275ceaf628e49d1854bbb0/header.jpg?t=1788072589", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/0fde8c0b179810e69fe9c19aeaeee8a382fc689c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788072589", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4862720/0fde8c0b179810e69fe9c19aeaeee8a382fc689c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788072589", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><b